ReasonforDeviation_Q4:
Traditional Leaders could not commit to availing land parcels due to the following:
•	No specific projects for specific land requirements were identified;
•	No clarification on beneficial participation by communities and compensation for their loss of rights on land;
•	Community resolutions which could not be done within the required timeline; and
•	The political process required for the Ingonyama Trust Land.
